                            {
                                "example_id": "712db353-2404-4c12-8bcd-f8081b9c6271",
                                "sense_id": "de19b06e-a0c9-3f1a-9f8a-a9c5f053fcfd",
                                "text": "Finally, corresponding to the \"Antarctic Archicontinent\" that was postulated by von IHERING (1890) and by AMEGHINO (1891) on the basis of palaeontological evidence, RAMOS (1984) has recently presented a reactivated hypothesis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c331925-6727-4b0f-86fe-5be55d474133",
                                "sense_id": "de19b06e-a0c9-3f1a-9f8a-a9c5f053fcfd",
                                "text": "The archicontinent marginal sedimentary transits to carbonate platform sedimentary from south to north, and the restricted platform and supratidal dolomitic flat develop."
